  "ruleText": "Rab 401.05 Appraisal Management Company Renewal Application. Each applicant for annual renewal of the appraisal management company registration shall provide the completed “Appraisal Management Company (AMC) Application for Practice in New Hampshire” required pursuant to Rab 308.01 (d).\n\nSource. #10270, eff 2-2-13, EXPIRED: 2-2-23\n\nNew. #13968, eff 5-18-24",
